@startuml
title <size:20><b>VoxFlow - Session State Machine Diagram</b></size>\n<size:12>Session Lifecycle and Processing States</size>

top to bottom direction

skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 170

skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #334155
    BorderThickness 1.5
    FontColor #0F172A
    FontSize 11
    FontStyle bold
}

skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.4

state "IDLE" as Idle #DBEAFE : System waiting for new session\nESP32 Status LED is OFF

state "SESSION_STARTED" as Started #E0F2FE : API session record initialized in SQLite\nSession status set to STARTED

state "RECORDING" as Recording #BFDBFE : Microphone actively capturing audio\nESP32 Status LED is ON (GPIO4 HIGH)

state "AUDIO_READY" as AudioReady #DDD6FE : Audio capture terminated & validated\nSession status set to STOPPED\nESP32 Status LED is OFF

state "ANALYZING" as Analyzing #C4B5FD : Sliding-window HuBERT-D inference\n& temporal event aggregation in progress

state "ANALYZED" as Analyzed #DCFCE7 : Results persisted to SQLite (voxflow.db)\nReady for interactive dashboard review

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> Started : POST /api/v1/session/start\nor WAV selection in UI

Started --> Recording : User presses START button (GPIO27)\nor bridge issues serial START

Recording --> AudioReady : Physical STOP button (GPIO33),\n60-second limit, or WAV file uploaded

AudioReady --> Analyzing : POST /api/v1/session/<id>/analyze\nor "Run Full Session Analysis" clicked

Analyzing --> Analyzed : Inference complete, thresholds applied,\nevents aggregated & summary computed

Analyzed --> Idle : Results stored; ready for next session

Idle --> [*] : System shutdown

@enduml